stateDiagram-v2
  s0 : Decision recorded
  s1 : Waiting for a person
  s2 : App about to act
  s3 : Verdict recorded, app not told yet
  s4 : App about to skip
  s5 : Action done, not recorded yet
  s6 : Skipped
  s7 : Done and authorized
  s8 : Skipped, then approved
  s9 : Done, flagged as without approval
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1 : the rule asks for a person
  s0 --> s2 : the rule allows the action and no person said no
  s0 --> s3 : the rule asks for a person
  s1 --> s3 : a person records approved, or a person records taken over, or a person records rejected
  s1 --> s4 : the wait times out
  s0 --> s4 : the rule allows the action, but a person said no first
  s2 --> s5 : the app acts
  s3 --> s2 : the app reads approved
  s3 --> s4 : the app reads rejected or taken over
  s4 --> s6 : the app records skipped
  s5 --> s7 : the app records done
  s4 --> s8 : the app records skipped
  s6 --> s8 : a person records approved
  s5 --> s9 : the app records done [a verdict came after its check]
  s6 --> [*]
  s7 --> [*]
  s8 --> [*]
  s9 --> [*]
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,color:#cd2834
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,color:#b85a06
  class s8 breaks
  class s9 breaks
